{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43595","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 常乐坊赵景公寺 吴画联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 常乐坊赵景公寺 吴画联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惨澹十堵内，吴生纵狂迹。\n风云将逼人，神鬼如脱壁。\n其中龙最怪，张甲方汗栗。\n黑云夜窸窣，焉知不霹雳。\n此际忽仙子，猎猎衣舃奕。\n妙瞬乍疑生，参差夺人魄。\n往往乘猛虎，冲梁耸奇石。\n苍峭束高泉，角膝惊欹侧。\n冥狱不可视，毛戴腋流液。\n苟能水成河，刹那沈火宅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}